{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24854","headline":"送公孙器自桂林归蜀 · 杨衡","name":"送公孙器自桂林归蜀","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"桂林浅复碧，潺湲半露石。\n将乘触物舟，暂驻飞空锡。\n蜀乡异青眼，蓬户高朱戟。\n风度杳难寻，云飘讵留迹。\n旧户闲花草，驯鸽傍檐隟。\n挥手共忘怀，日堕千山夕。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杨衡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24854.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24854","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}